WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:01.025
Start with one.

00:01.693 --> 00:06.003
This is the International Space Station, about four hundred kilometres up.

00:06.503 --> 00:11.445
It moves at eight kilometres every second and circles the Earth sixteen times a day.

00:11.986 --> 00:14.151
Hold on to that height and that speed.

00:14.690 --> 00:17.022
Nearly everything else on this trip shares them.
